description_text:
-      Creature head sculpt created in Zbrush;

  -      High poly mesh data only, no UVs, no textures;

  -     Available file formats:

  -     ZPR (Zbrush 2020 or higher)

  -     OBJ

  -     STL

The object is modeled in the environment SolidWorks 2016. To create a photo renderer, use Inventor Studio 2019.
The model contains the most popular formats:

  - .max (version 2016,2013);

  - .fbx;

  - .dwg;

  - .stp;

  - .obj;

  - .stl;

  - .igs;

  - and more.

The model contains the most popular formats. Each file was checked for opening and full content by the model.
Thank you for coming to see this model. Also pay attention to other models by clicking on the name of the account in the right corner.

Male.
There are five character animations:
Idle;
Walking;
Running;
Jumping;
Death.
There are also character textures and several model formats.

